# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0005739> (mitochondrion)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "GOC:giardia") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "ISBN:0198506732") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0005739> "A semiautonomous, self replicating organelle that occurs in varying numbers, shapes, and sizes in the cytoplasm of virtually all eukaryotic cells. It is notably the site of tissue respiration.")
